The '''Elephant''' is a {{Skl|Farming}} [[Pets|Pet]] that can be bought from {{NPCSprite|Oringo}} during the [[Traveling Zoo]] Event. It grants a bonus to {{stat|hp}} and {{stat|int}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Elephant Pet''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Oringo;Oringo the Traveling Zookeeper}} during the [[Traveling Zoo]] event. Its price is dependent on its [[Rarity]].
