== Trivia ==

* When it was originally released in [[Changelog/2020/May 5|v0.7.8]], the Elephant Pet's {{AN|Trunk Efficiency}} perk multiplied crop drops. In v0.9.11, its multiplier was increased from 1.2x to 1.6x, but it remained multiplicative due to a bug until it was converted to {{Stat|Farming Fortune}} in v0.11.0.

